# Forensic Gadgeteer: "Activated abilities of artifacts you control cost {1} less to activate." A Basking Rootwalla is not an
# artifact: its {1}{G} ability costs the full two mana, paid with two Forests, and nothing is left in the pool
# (a discounted cost would leave a mana floating). The Rootwalla becomes a 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Forensic Gadgeteer
Basking Rootwalla
Forest
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Forensic Gadgeteer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Basking Rootwalla.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Basking Rootwalla.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Basking Rootwalla.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Basking Rootwalla.Toughness = 3
